[2026-03-15T09:36:08.389Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ls3EScMG91tayaUW1rJfuR","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (94.6KB). Full output saved to: /home/agent/.claude/projects/-repo/1be6b722-4a09-4a27-a831-da3ee866becd/tool-results/toolu_01Ls3EScMG91tayaUW1rJfuR.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n     1→# Google Flights Clone — Test Specification\n     2→\n     3→## Page: Search Page (Home)\n     4→\n     5→### Components\n     6→- TripTypeSelector\n     7→- PassengerCountSelector\n     8→- CabinClassSelector\n     9→- AirportAutocomplete\n    10→- DatePicker\n    11→- SearchButton\n    12→- RecentSearches\n    13→- PopularDestinations\n    14→\n    15→### TripTypeSelector\n    16→\n    17→#### Test: TripTypeSelector displays default \"Round trip\" selection\n    18→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n    19→- **Initial state**: Search page loads with default settings\n    20→- **Action**: User observes the trip type selector\n    21→- **Expected**: The selector displays \"Round trip\" as the default selected option. It is rendered as a custom dropdown (not a native select element).\n    22→\n    23→#### Test: TripTypeSelector opens dropdown and shows all options\n    24→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n    25→- **Initial state**: Search page loaded, trip type selector is closed\n    26→- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector\n    27→- **Expected**: A dropdown menu opens showing three options: \"Round trip\", \"One way\", and \"Multi-city\". Each option is clickable.\n    28→\n    29→#### Test: TripTypeSelector selects \"One way\" and hides return date\n    30→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector, DatePicker\n    31→- **Initial state**: Search page loaded with \"Round trip\" selected, return date picker is visible\n    32→- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"One way\"\n    33→- **Expected**: The selector updates to show \"One way\". The return date picker is