d, then switches to \"Upcoming\" tab and back to \"Tracked\" tab\n1164-- **Expected**: The Tracked tab consistently shows only 2 remaining tracked route cards. The untracked route does not reappear.\n1165-\n1166-#### Test: TrackedRouteCard Search button works for multiple cards\n--\n1215-\n1216-#### Test: CancelBookingModal cancelled trip persists in correct tab\n1217:- **Components**: CancelBookingModal, TripCard, TripsTabs\n1218-- **Initial state**: User cancels an upcoming booking via the modal\n1219-- **Action**: User switches to \"Past\" tab and back to \"Upcoming\" tab\n1220-- **Expected**: The cancelled trip still appears in the \"Upcoming\" tab (since the departure date is still in the future) with the \"Cancelled\" status badge. It is not duplicated across tabs.\n1221-\n1222-## Page: Explore"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1be6b722-4a09-4a27-a831-da3ee866becd","uuid":"02ce193d-8b5c-4706-b6c4-b28b5a87f771","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"979-\n980-### Components\n981:- TripsTabs\n982-- TripCard\n983-- TrackedRouteCard\n984-- CancelBookingModal\n985-\n986:### TripsTabs\n987-\n988:#### Test: TripsTabs displays three tabs\n989:- **Components**: TripsTabs\n990-- **Initial state**: User navigates to the My Trips page\n991-- **Action**: User observes the tab bar at the top of the page\n992-- **Expected**: Three tabs are displayed: \"Upcoming\", \"Past\", and \"Tracked\". The \"Upcoming\" tab is selected by default and visually highlighted (e.g., underline or bold text with primary color #1A73E8).\n993-\n994:#### Test: TripsTabs switches to Past tab\n995:- **Components**: TripsTabs, TripCard\n996-- **Initial state**: My Trips page loaded with \"Upcoming\" tab active, user has both upcoming and past bookings\n997-- **Action**: User clicks the \"Past\" tab\n998-- **Expected**: The \"Past\" tab becomes visually selected. The content area updates to show only trips with past departure dates (status \"Completed\" or