[2026-03-15T09:37:29.273Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XNvXTThR1jKgFBXXeHubpe","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed to provide a comprehensive report. Let me compile all the findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Analysis: My Trips Page and TripsTabs Component\n\n### 1. **Routing Setup** (`/trips` route)\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx`\n\nThe `/trips` route is configured in the main App component using React Router:\n```typescript\n<Route path=\"/trips\" element={<MyTripsPage />} />\n```\n\n### 2. **TripsTabs Component**\n\n**Main Component File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n\nThe TripsTabs component is a simple tab selector with three tabs:\n- **Upcoming** - for future bookings\n- **Past** - for completed bookings\n- **Tracked** - for price-tracked routes\n\nIt uses Redux to manage active tab state via `setActiveTab` action. The component renders three buttons with conditional styling applied to the active tab. Each tab has a data-testid attribute (`trips-tab-{key}`).\n\n**Styling File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.css`\n\nThe CSS provides:\n- Flexbox layout with gap and bottom border styling\n- Tab button styling with hover and active states\n- Color and transition effects using CSS variables\n\n### 3. **My Trips Page Component**\n\n**Main Component File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx`\n\nThe MyTripsPage component:\n- Fetches bookings and tracked routes on mount using `fetchMyBookings` and `fetchTrackedRoutes` thunks\n- Separates bookings into upcoming (departure_time >= now) and past (departure_time < now)\n- Renders conditional content based on the active tab:\n  - **Upcoming tab:** Shows upcoming bookings with cancel buttons\n  - **Past tab:** Shows past bookings without cancel buttons\n  - **Tracked tab:** Shows tracked routes with untrack functionality\n- Includes loading states and empty states for each tab\n- Handles booking cancellation with a modal dialog (CancelBookingModal)\n- Handles route untracking\n- Uses session tokens stored in localStorage for API authentication\n\n**Page Styling File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.css`\n\nProvides:\n- Page layout with max-width and centered content\n- Title styling\n- List and empty state styling\n- Loading state styling\n- Responsive design (max-width: 640px)\n\n### 4. **Redux Slice for Trips/Bookings**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/tripsSlice.ts`\n\nThis Redux slice manages:\n\n**State Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface TripsState {\n  bookings: BookingTrip[]\n  trackedRoutes: TrackedRoute[]\n  loading: boolean\n  trackedLoading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n  activeTab: TripsTab (type: 'upcoming' | 'past' | 'tracked')\n  cancellingBookingId: string | null\n  cancelError: string | null\n  untrackingRouteId: string | null\n}\n```\n\n**Data Types:**\n- `BookingTrip` - Contains flight booking details (id, price, status, departure/arrival times, airline info, route details, etc.)\n- `TrackedRoute` - Contains price tracking details (origin/dest codes and cities, cabin class, lowest price, price trend)\n\n**Async Thunks (API Calls):**\n1. `fetchMyBookings` - GET `/api/my-bookings?session={sessionToken}`\n2. `fetchTrackedRoutes` - GET `/api/tracked-routes?session={sessionToken}`\n3. `cancelBooking` - PATCH `/api/my-bookings` with bookingId and status='cancelled'\n4. `untrackRoute` - DELETE `/api/tracked-routes` with routeId\n\n**Synchronous Reducers:**\n- `setActiveTab(state, action)` - Sets the active tab\n- `clearCancelError(state)` - Clears cancel operation errors\n\n**Extra Reducers (Async Handlers):**\n- Handle pending/fulfilled/rejected states for all async thunks\n- Update UI states like loading indicators and error messages\n- Modify booking status on successful cancellation\n- Remove routes from list on successful untrack\n\n### 5. **Related Components Used**\n\n**TripCard** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripCard.tsx`):\n- Displays individual booking details with airline info, route, dates, price, and status\n- Shows cancel button only for confirmed upcoming trips\n- Includes formatted date and price display utilities\n\n**TrackedRouteCard** - Used for displaying tracked routes\n**CancelBookingModal** - Modal dialog for confirming booking cancellations\n\n### 6. **Store Configuration**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/store.ts`\n\nThe Redux store includes:\n- `trips` reducer (from tripsSlice.ts)\n- Other reducers for search, flights, booking, and explore features\n\n### Summary of Files\n\nHere are all the key files involved in the My Trips page:\n\n1. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx` - Routing configuration\n2. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx` - Main page component\n3. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.css` - Page styling\n4. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx` - Tab selector component\n5. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.css` - Tab styling\n6. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/tripsSlice.ts` - Redux slice with state management and async thunks\n7. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/store.ts` - Redux store configuration\n8. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripCard.tsx` - Booking card display component\n9. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/CancelBookingModal.tsx` - Cancellation confirmation modal\n10. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TrackedRouteCard.tsx` - Tracked route display component"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a3d89807248daa454 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 30128\ntool_uses: 23\nduration_ms: 25920</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1be6b722-4a09-4a27-a831-da3ee866becd","uuid":"fa253418-14de-44de-a77a-8ae91401af66","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/GoogleFlights, find the component(s) that render the My Trips page and the TripsTabs component. I need to see:\n1. The routing setup (how /trips route is configured)\n2. The TripsTabs component code\n3. The My Trips page component\n4. Any related Redux slices for trips/bookings\n\nSearch for files containing \"trips-tabs\", \"TripsTabs\", \"my-trips\", \"trips-tab-upcoming\", \"trips-tab-past\", \"trips-tab-tracked\", \"trips-upcoming-list\", \"trips-past-list\", \"trips-tracked-list\", \"trips-empty-upcoming\", \"trips-empty-past\", \"trips-empty-tracked\".\n\nRead the full source code of all relevant components.","agentId":"a3d89807248daa454","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed to provide a comprehensive report. Let me compile all the findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Analysis: My Trips Page and TripsTabs Component\n\n### 1. **Routing Setup** (`/trips` route)\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx`\n\nThe `/trips` route is configured in the main App component using React Router:\n```typescript\n<Route path=\"/trips\" element={<MyTripsPage />} />\n```\n\n### 2. **TripsTabs Component**\n\n**Main Component File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n\nThe TripsTabs component is a simple tab selector with three tabs:\n- **Upcoming** - for future bookings\n- **Past** - for completed bookings\n- **Tracked** - for price-tracked routes\n\nIt uses Redux to manage active tab state via `setActiveTab` action. The component renders three buttons with conditional styling applied to the active tab. Each tab has a data-testid attribute (`trips-tab-{key}`).\n\n**Styling File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.css`\n\nThe CSS provides:\n- Flexbox layout with gap and bottom border styling\n- Tab button styling with hover and active states\n- Color and transition effects using CSS variables\n\n### 3. **My Trips Page Component**\n\n**Main Component File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx`\n\nThe MyTripsPage component:\n- Fetches bookings and tracked routes on mount using `fetchMyBookings` and `fetchTrackedRoutes` thunks\n- Separates bookings into upcoming (departure_time >= now) and past (departure_time < now)\n- Renders conditional content based on the active tab:\n  - **Upcoming tab:** Shows upcoming bookings with cancel buttons\n  - **Past tab:** Shows past bookings without cancel buttons\n  - **Tracked tab:** Shows tracked routes with untrack functionality\n- Includes loading states and empty states for each tab\n- Handles booking cancellation with a modal dialog (CancelBookingModal)\n- Handles route untracking\n- Uses session tokens stored in localStorage for API authentication\n\n**Page Styling File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.css`\n\nProvides:\n- Page layout with max-width and centered content\n- Title styling\n- List and empty state styling\n- Loading state styling\n- Responsive design (max-width: 640px)\n\n### 4. **Redux Slice for Trips/Bookings**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/tripsSlice.ts`\n\nThis Redux slice manages:\n\n**State Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface TripsState {\n  bookings: BookingTrip[]\n  trackedRoutes: TrackedRoute[]\n  loading: boolean\n  trackedLoading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n  activeTab: TripsTab (type: 'upcoming' | 'past' | 'tracked')\n  cancellingBookingId: string | null\n  cancelError: string | null\n  untrackingRouteId: string | null\n}\n```\n\n**Data Types:**\n- `BookingTrip` - Contains flight booking details (id, price, status, departure/arrival times, airline info, route details, etc.)\n- `TrackedRoute` - Contains price tracking details (origin/dest codes and cities, cabin class, lowest price, price trend)\n\n**Async Thunks (API Calls):**\n1. `fetchMyBookings` - GET `/api/my-bookings?session={sessionToken}`\n2. `fetchTrackedRoutes` - GET `/api/tracked-routes?session={sessionToken}`\n3. `cancelBooking` - PATCH `/api/my-bookings` with bookingId and status='cancelled'\n4. `untrackRoute` - DELETE `/api/tracked-routes` with routeId\n\n**Synchronous Reducers:**\n- `setActiveTab(state, action)` - Sets the active tab\n- `clearCancelError(state)` - Clears cancel operation errors\n\n**Extra Reducers (Async Handlers):**\n- Handle pending/fulfilled/rejected states for all async thunks\n- Update UI states like loading indicators and error messages\n- Modify booking status on successful cancellation\n- Remove routes from list on successful untrack\n\n### 5. **Related Components Used**\n\n**TripCard** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripCard.tsx`):\n- Displays individual booking details with airline info, route, dates, price, and status\n- Shows cancel button only for confirmed upcoming trips\n- Includes formatted date and price display utilities\n\n**TrackedRouteCard** - Used for displaying tracked routes\n**CancelBookingModal** - Modal dialog for confirming booking cancellations\n\n### 6. **Store Configuration**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/store.ts`\n\nThe Redux store includes:\n- `trips` reducer (from tripsSlice.ts)\n- Other reducers for search, flights, booking, and explore features\n\n### Summary of Files\n\nHere are all the key files involved in the My Trips page:\n\n1. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx` - Routing configuration\n2. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx` - Main page component\n3. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.css` - Page styling\n4. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx` - Tab selector component\n5. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.css` - Tab styling\n6. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/tripsSlice.ts` - Redux slice with state management and async thunks\n7. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/store.ts` - Redux store configuration\n8. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripCard.tsx` - Booking card display component\n9. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/CancelBookingModal.tsx` - Cancellation confirmation modal\n10. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TrackedRouteCard.tsx` - Tracked route display component"}],"totalDurationMs":25920,"totalTokens":30128,"totalToolUseCount":23,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1574,"cache_read_input_tokens":27042,"output_tokens":1505,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1574},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
